{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34386","headline":"同袭美游北禅院 · 陆龟蒙","name":"同袭美游北禅院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连延花蔓映风廊，岸帻披襟到竹房。\n居士祗今开梵处，先生曾是草玄堂。\n清尊林下看香印，远岫窗中挂鉢囊。\n今日有情消未得，欲将名理问思光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}